sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OAuthProxy as oauth-proxy Sidecar<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant RESTProxy as REST Proxy<br/>8008/TCP HTTP
    participant MM as ModelMesh (mm)<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant ModelServer as Model Server<br/>(Triton/MLServer/OVMS/TorchServe)
    participant Controller as modelmesh-controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant etcd as etcd Cluster<br/>2379/TCP gRPC
    participant S3 as S3/GCS Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Puller as Storage Helper/Puller

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Model Inference Request (gRPC)
    Client->>OAuthProxy: HTTPS POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>Auth: OpenShift OAuth Token
    OAuthProxy->>RESTProxy: HTTP POST (localhost)<br/>No encryption (loopback)
    RESTProxy->>MM: gRPC InferRequest (localhost)<br/>No encryption (loopback/Unix socket)
    MM->>ModelServer: gRPC ModelInfer<br/>8001/TCP or 7070/TCP (localhost)
    ModelServer-->>MM: Prediction Result
    MM-->>RESTProxy: gRPC Response
    RESTProxy-->>OAuthProxy: HTTP Response
    OAuthProxy-->>Client: HTTPS JSON Response

    Note over Controller,S3: Flow 2: Model Registration and Loading
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Predictor CR<br/>HTTPS/443 Bearer Token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Predictor Created Event
    Controller->>MM: gRPC SetVModel<br/>8033/TCP TLS (configurable) mTLS
    MM->>etcd: Register VModel entry<br/>2379/TCP gRPC TLS
    etcd-->>MM: Confirmed
    MM->>Puller: Trigger model download
    Puller->>S3: GET model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443 AWS IAM
    S3-->>Puller: Model artifacts
    Puller->>ModelServer: Load model<br/>HTTP/8086 (localhost)
    ModelServer-->>MM: Model loaded status
    MM-->>Controller: VModel status update (via etcd watch)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Predictor status<br/>HTTPS/443 Bearer Token

    Note over Controller,etcd: Flow 3: Controller Reconciliation Loop
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CRD Watch Events<br/>(Predictor, ServingRuntime, InferenceService)
    etcd-->>Controller: Model lifecycle events<br/>2379/TCP gRPC TLS
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments, Services<br/>HTTPS/443 Bearer Token
    Controller->>MM: SetVModel / DeleteVModel<br/>gRPC/8033 TLS mTLS
